          "cluster": "goth-5",
          "text": "Cute things with a creepy twist are my favourite.",
          "dimensions": {
            "whimsy": 2,
            "optimism": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9306,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-6",
          "text": "Memories of hanging out at the mall in band shirts make me smile.",
          "dimensions": {
            "nostalgia": 2,
            "retro": 1,
            "refinement": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9307,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-7",
          "text": "Going out with my scene matters a lot to me.",
          "dimensions": {
            "community": 2,
            "social": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9308,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-8",
          "text": "Old small towns far from the city feel haunted in a way I like.",
          "dimensions": {
            "nature": 1,
            "urban": -2,
            "tradition": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9309,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-9",
          "text": "Sad poems move me more than happy songs.",
          "dimensions": {
            "melancholy": 2,
            "optimism": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9310,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-10",
          "text": "A cosy, cluttered room with candles and crystals sounds perfect.",
          "dimensions": {
            "comfort": 2,
            "mystery": 1,
            "minimalism": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9311,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-11",
          "text": "I'm drawn to the past more than to the future.",
          "dimensions": {
            "history": 2,
            "futurism": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9312,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-12",
          "text": "Gardens, forests and graveyards feel calmer to me than cities.",
          "dimensions": {
            "nature": 2,
            "solitude": 1,
            "urban": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9313,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-13",
          "text": "Elegant and refined matters more to me than tough and rough.",
          "dimensions": {
            "refinement": 2,
            "realism": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9314,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-14",
          "text": "Rough and raw looks better to me than pretty and polished.",
          "dimensions": {
            "realism": 2,
            "refinement": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9315,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-15",
          "text": "I like things neat, tidy and under control.",
          "dimensions": {
            "order": 2,
            "chaos": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9316,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-16",
          "text": "Old records and the original eighties scene are my thing.",
          "dimensions": {
            "retro": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9317,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-17",
          "text": "I'd rather keep to myself than be part of a scene.",
          "dimensions": {
            "solitude": 2,
            "community": -1,
            "social": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9318,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-18",
          "text": "Traditions that have lasted a long time matter to me.",
          "dimensions": {
            "tradition": 2,
            "modernity": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9319,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-19",
          "text": "Being different from everyone around me is important to me.",
          "dimensions": {
            "individualism": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9320,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-20",
          "text": "The unknown and the unexplained are a big part of what I love.",
          "dimensions": {
            "mystery": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9321,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-21",
          "text": "Bright colours have a place in a dark wardrobe.",
          "dimensions": {
            "whimsy": 1,
            "maximalism": 1,
            "optimism": 1,
            "darkness": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9322,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-22",
          "text": "I'm more excited about what comes next than nostalgic about what came before.",
          "dimensions": {
            "modernity": 2,
            "futurism": 1,
            "nostalgia": -2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9323,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-23",
          "text": "I'd rather be alone in nature than out at a club.",
          "dimensions": {
            "nature": 1,
            "solitude": 2,
            "community": -1,
            "urban": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9324,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-24",
          "text": "New trends and pop culture are a big part of my style.",
          "dimensions": {
            "modernity": 2,
            "history": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9325,
          "group": "goth",
          "cluster": "goth-25",
          "text": "Ruins overgrown with ivy are more beautiful to me than any new building.",
          "dimensions": {
            "nature": 1,
            "history": 1,
            "melancholy": 1,
            "modernity": -1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
